'''Tanilaeh Sunkiss''' is a [[high elf]] who was located in the [[Golden Dawn Institute]] in [[Alah'Thalas]] and teleported adventurers to [[Stormwind City]].

==Quests==
* {{questlong|Alliance|10|To Alah'Thalas!}} {{questfinish}}
* {{questlong|Alliance|10|Welcome to Alah'Thalas}} {{queststart}}

==Notes==
* After the addition of the [[Thalassian Highlands]] to the game, Tanilaeh Sunkiss was replaced at the Golden Dawn Institute by [[Magistrix Ishalah]], who was moved from the Farstrider Lodge to the new high elf starting area.

